  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "Most structurally related molecules show direct evidence of BBB penetration after systemic administration, including brain detection in rats, mice, and primates; two analogs show poor CNS penetration, but the preponderance of direct in-vivo evidence supports meaningful CNS access.",
